.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-notifications-dnd 1 "" "Sway Things 0.4.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-notifications\-dnd \- Show whether Do Not Disturb is on, or switch it: for mako, swaync and dunst
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things notifications dnd\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISTATE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show whether Do Not Disturb is on, or switch it: for mako, swaync and dunst
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fISTATE\fR]
on, off or toggle; without, print the state (on or off)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on: Switch it on
.IP \(bu 2
off: Switch it off
.IP \(bu 2
toggle: Switch it to the other state
.RE
